Package: katu-core
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Katu OS Team <katuos@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-requests, katu-release
Recommends: python3-dbus, libnotify-bin, python3-secretstorage
Priority: required
Section: misc
Description: Katu OS Core Library
 Shared Python library used by all Katu OS applications.
 Provides: system information, configuration management,
 desktop notifications, action registry, package management
 integration, secure secret storage and shared UI kit.
